===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|демокра́тія||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:bor|de:Demokratie|tree=1}}
Ultimately from {{der|ru|la|democratia}} and {{der|ru|grc|δημοκρατία}}. First attested in 1704 as ''димократия'', mimicking the Greek pronunciation. 

The current form "демократия" most likely stems from {{bor|ru|de|Demokratie}}. Had it been borrowed from French or Polish, it would have yielded "демокрация".

